 an acceptable frozen-drug-substance set point.\nThe observed lane-4 excursion was minus 54 degrees Celsius for twenty-two minutes. Disposition requires product-specific stability review; duration alone neither releases nor rejects the material.\nA probe, logger, pallet map, shipping lane, freezer controller, or packaging configuration change makes prior mapping evidence stale.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nASSAY owns product disposition evidence, SUPPLY owns lane and packaging availability, and SIGNAL owns current alarm delivery evidence.\nCHANGE binds the evaluated packaging and controller versions; CHARTER retains release authority separation.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| CLD-000 | freezer-1 | v3 | -70.0 | degrees-celsius | superseded |\n| CLD-001 | freezer-2 | v3 | -68.3 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-002 | shipping-lane | v3 | -69.5 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-003 | staging-room | v3 | -67.8 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-004 | freezer-1 | v3 | -69.0 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-005 | freezer-2 | v3 | -67.3 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-006 | shipping-lane | v3 | -68.5 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-007 | staging-room | v3 | -69.7 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-008 | freezer-1 | v3 | -68.0 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-009 | freezer-2 | v3 | -69.2 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-010 | shipping-lane | v3 | -67.5 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-011 | staging-room | v3 | -68.7 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-012 | freezer-1 | v4 | -69.9 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-013 | freezer-2 | v4 | -68.2 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-014 | shipping-lane | v4 | -69.4 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-015 | staging-room | v4 | -67.7 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-016 | freezer-1 | v4 | -68.9 | degrees-celsius | current |\n| CLD-017 | freezer-2 | v4 | -67.2 | degrees-celsius | superseded |\n|