lier continuity\n\n## Frozen findings\n\nCurrent diesel stock covers twenty-eight hours at emergency load and seventeen hours at full production load. The two consumption regimes must remain distinct.\nSterile stopper stock covers 4.2 production days, while chromatography resin covers 2.6 batches. Days and batches are different inventory measures.\nMutual aid provides five qualified operators beginning at 05:30 UTC with travel uncertainty of plus or minus seventy-five minutes.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nCURRENT generator duration depends on SUPPLY fuel; STERILE depends on stoppers; CULTURE depends on resin and qualified staffing.\nCHILL shipping alternatives require approved packaging and current lane qualification before use.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| SUP-000 | resin | v3 | 31.0 | hours-cover | superseded |\n| SUP-001 | stoppers | v3 | 32.7 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-002 | diesel | v3 | 31.5 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-003 | operators | v3 | 33.2 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-004 | resin | v3 | 32.0 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-005 | stoppers | v3 | 33.7 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-006 | diesel | v3 | 32.5 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-007 | operators | v3 | 31.3 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-008 | resin | v3 | 33.0 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-009 | stoppers | v3 | 31.8 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-010 | diesel | v3 | 33.5 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-011 | operators | v3 | 32.3 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-012 | resin | v4 | 31.1 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-013 | stoppers | v4 | 32.8 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-014 | diesel | v4 | 31.6 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-015 | operators | v4 | 33.3 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-016 | resin | v4 | 32.1 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-017 | stoppers | v4 | 33.8 | hours-cover | superseded |\n| SUP-018 | diesel | v4 | 32.6 | hours-cover | current |\n| SUP-019 | o