cords must be retained for seven years with access provenance.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nSIGNAL supplies alarm evidence and CURRENT supplies utility state. CHARTER owns materiality determination; a semantic record cannot make the legal determination.\nCOMMUNE supplies notice-delivery records and GUARD protects sensitive facility details.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| ENV-000 | solvent-room | v3 | 24.0 | hours | superseded |\n| ENV-001 | waste-tank | v3 | 25.7 | hours | current |\n| ENV-002 | exhaust | v3 | 24.5 | hours | current |\n| ENV-003 | neutralization | v3 | 26.2 | hours | current |\n| ENV-004 | solvent-room | v3 | 25.0 | hours | current |\n| ENV-005 | waste-tank | v3 | 26.7 | hours | current |\n| ENV-006 | exhaust | v3 | 25.5 | hours | current |\n| ENV-007 | neutralization | v3 | 24.3 | hours | current |\n| ENV-008 | solvent-room | v3 | 26.0 | hours | current |\n| ENV-009 | waste-tank | v3 | 24.8 | hours | current |\n| ENV-010 | exhaust | v3 | 26.5 | hours | current |\n| ENV-011 | neutralization | v3 | 25.3 | hours | current |\n| ENV-012 | solvent-room | v4 | 24.1 | hours | current |\n| ENV-013 | waste-tank | v4 | 25.8 | hours | current |\n| ENV-014 | exhaust | v4 | 24.6 | hours | current |\n| ENV-015 | neutralization | v4 | 26.3 | hours | current |\n| ENV-016 | solvent-room | v4 | 25.1 | hours | current |\n| ENV-017 | waste-tank | v4 | 26.8 | hours | superseded |\n| ENV-018 | exhaust | v4 | 25.6 | hours | current |\n| ENV-019 | neutralization | v4 | 24.4 | hours | current |\n| ENV-020 | solvent-room | v4 | 26.1 | hours | current |\n| ENV-021 | waste-tank | v4 | 24.9 | hours | current |\n| ENV-022 | exhaust | v4 | 26.6 | hours | current |\n| ENV-023 | neutralization | v4 | 25.4 | hours | current |\n| ENV-024 | solvent-room | v5 | 24.2 | hours | current |\n| ENV-025 | waste-tank | v5 | 25.9 | hours | current |\n| ENV-026 | exhaust | v5 | 24.7 | hours | current |\