\n\nUse exact task actions to inspect evidence, build the exact task artifacts,\ncheck the current candidate, repair real blockers, and propose submission only\nwhen the current candidate has a current passing check. Exact sources, effects,\nchecks, and history remain externally custodied and reopenable.\n\nAny semantic scaffold is lossy, incomplete, non-authoritative, and source-bound.\nUse it as provisional construction support, never as release, restart, or\nclosure authority. Preserve exact values, units, signs, locations, modalities,\nversions, qualifications, and authority boundaries. A candidate mutation makes\nprior checks stale until the changed candidate is checked.\n\nReturn exactly one declared JSON action and no prose.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n# Orchard Biologics Restart Decision Task\n\nProduce two exact, source-grounded work products for the synthetic Orchard\nbiologics facility:\n\n1. `EVIDENCE_INTEGRATION_LEDGER.md`, beginning with exactly\n   `# Orchard Evidence and Decision Matrix`.\n2. `BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md`, beginning with exactly\n   `# Orchard Biologics Restart Decision` and containing exactly these ordered\n   level-two headings:\n\n   1. `Authority, scope, and restart states`\n   2. `Process, genealogy, and hold-time controls`\n   3. `Aseptic, analytical, and cold-chain release gates`\n   4. `Utilities, materials, staffing, and staged restart`\n   5. `Cybersecurity, telemetry, and evidence custody`\n   6. `Safety, environmental, and communication continuity`\n   7. `Execution, rollback, and contingencies`\n   8. `Verification, blockers, falsifiers, and closure`\n\nThe final decision must contain 1,400–1,900 words excluding bracketed source\ncitations and cite at least ten distinct exact source IDs. It must reconcile\nauthority, process performance, aseptic controls, cold-chain excursion,\nutilities, analytical disposition, cybersecurity, materials/staffing,\nenvironmental duties, monitoring, communications, candidate lineage, and\nindependent readiness.\n\nDo not merely list facts. Bind every action and gate to owners, prerequisites,\nobservations, current candidate/version, falsifiers, rollback, and evidence that\nretires temporary controls. Preserve exact distinctions including observations\nversus gates, alert versus action limits, installed versus usable capacity,\npercent versus probability, hours versus days, source-local authority, and\ncurrent versus stale evidence.\n\nThe task-native artifacts are exact cumulative work. Checks are candidate-bound\nmechanical feedback and do not independently authorize lot release, commercial\nrestart, or closure.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n# Orchard action contract\n\nReturn exactly one JSON object using one currently allowed action.\n\n```text\n{\"action\":\"read_source\",\"source_id\":\"CHARTER\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60}\n{\"action\":\"read_batch\",\"requests\":[{\"source_id\":\"CHARTER\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60},{\"source_id\":\"CULTURE\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60}]}\n{\"action\":\"reopen_exact\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-001\"}\n{\"action\":\"replace_evidence_ledger\",\"content\":\"complete compact task-native matrix\"}\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"heading\":\"Authority, scope, and restart states\",\"body\":\"exact section body\"}\n{\"action\":\"patch_decision\",\"edits\":[{\"old\":\"exact unique text\",\"new\":\"replacement text\"}]}\n{\"action\":\"replace_decision\",\"content\":\"complete exact decision\"}\n{\"action\":\"begin_verification\"}\n{\"action\":\"run_check\"}\n{\"action\":\"submit\"}\n```\n\nOne read may contain at most 120 lines. One batch may contain one or two ranges,\nat most 160 total lines and 12,000 source bytes. Same-source ranges may not\noverlap. Use exact catalog IDs and in-range bounds.\n\n`begin_verification` is valid only after the frozen mechanical construction\nmilestone passes. It changes phase, not candidate bytes, and does not assert\nreadiness. A successful patch makes every earlier check stale. Submission does\nnot self-authorize readiness.\n\n\n# Common pre-fork action notice\nNo semantic-maintenance output is present during pressure screening. Both future configurations share this ordinary action surface and exact task work.\n\n# Exact source catalog\n{\"schema\":\"architecture-source-catalog-v0\",\"sources\":[{\"line_count\":64,\"sha256\":\"6cb6875c0d4316fa8be25f0b568bd2924e571af7f2cb30e755336344339e5174\",\"size_bytes\":3964,\"source_id\":\"CHARTER\",\"title\":\"Restart authority and accountable disposition\"},{\"line_count\":64,\"sha256\":\"4afe715ed5a632f384658d45a19fda0c6f1bc5476bc24ab525c75687df9c5d46\",\"size_bytes\":3843,\"source_id\":\"CULTURE\",\"title\":\"Bioreactor state, yield, and hold-time evidence\"},{\"line_count\":64,\"sha256\":\"19a5fe9d20e744fef04763096ac79029de041a7a5b0004926e87761852415188\",\"size_bytes\":3468,\"source_id\":\"STERILE\",\"title\":\"Aseptic processing and contamination-control evidence\"},{\"line_count\":64,\"sha256\":\"19adb344c96282fbb4bac930bd01230e5d1d1d4ac513e17a22e176671be5af62\",\"size_bytes\":3994,\"source_id\":\"CHILL\",\"title\":\"Cold-chain mapping, excursion, and disposition\"},{\"line_count\":64,\"sha256\":\"12b2bcc5b451921b38d9af555f68af1d74e8673e4c037b2ec3d5ef1e6a1b0a55\",\"size_bytes\":3820,\"source_id\":\"CURRENT\",\"title\":\"Clean utilities, power, and capacity\"},{\"line_count\":64,\"sha256\":\"06b691266e9619612bfca550779938fc481d39a96385115299e737f310b306d5\",\"size_bytes\":3806,\"source_id\":\"ASSAY\",\"title\":\"Analytical results, specification, and lot disposition\"},{\"line_count\":64,\"sha256\":\"7dfea87e46a18ed29a974a3175fa0aaf0f31b817a9f7017471ed667e396786e5\",\"size_bytes\":3437,\"source_id\":\"GUARD\",\"title\":\"Control-system access, integrity, and evidence custody\"},{\"line_count\":64,\"sha256\":\"5a97d24e023016fa9921576e3584309b03359570afe41d30ad2e8f7084b5fc50\",\"size_bytes\":3505,\"source_id\":\"SUPPLY\",\"title\":\"Materials, fuel, staffing, and s