ry_ordinal\":7,\"exact_result_sha256\":\"8f6550094cf1f2d4106fab3dbc3671d3e88c7fc7b42055910963499030803f6f\",\"exact_result_size_bytes\":8996,\"object_id\":\"batch:COMMUNE:1-64+CHANGE:1-64\",\"object_version\":\"c11698048769adf0b677163e15dd7ada8564a747595437aacb4b35c6aef163e1\",\"observed_ranges\":[{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"COMMUNE\",\"start_line\":1},{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"CHANGE\",\"start_line\":1}],\"previously_model_visible\":true,\"reopen_action\":{\"action\":\"reopen_exact\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-006\"},\"reopen_handle\":\"result://sha256/8f6550094cf1f2d4106fab3dbc3671d3e88c7fc7b42055910963499030803f6f\",\"resident\":false,\"result_id\":\"RESULT-006\",\"result_kind\":\"source_observation\",\"schema_version\":\"ceiba-exact-result-receipt-v1\",\"source_id\":null,\"source_ids\":[\"COMMUNE\",\"CHANGE\"],\"source_path\":null,\"source_sha256\":null,\"source_size_bytes\":null,\"total_source_bytes\":8493}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n# Current Orchard lifecycle phase\nPhase: construction. `run_check` and `submit` are not currently available. Build exact task work and use `begin_verification` after the frozen mechanical construction milestone is met.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"read_batch\",\"requests\":[{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"CHARTER\",\"start_line\":1},{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"REVIEW\",\"start_line\":1}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"batch:CHARTER:1-64+REVIEW:1-64\",\"object_version\":\"24c227b89842c953dd8a5569798ecb8ef95e6c5963cc7184fbcbc43133787808\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-007\",\"result_kind\":\"source_observation\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"schema\":\"architecture-batch-observation-v0\",\"segments\":[{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"CHARTER\",\"start_line\":1},{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"REVIEW\",\"start_line\":1}],\"total_source_bytes\":8142}\n--- exact batch segment 1 ---\n{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"CHARTER\",\"source_path\":\"sources/CHARTER_AUTHORITY.md\",\"source_sha256\":\"6cb6875c0d4316fa8be25f0b568bd2924e571af7f2cb30e755336344339e5174\",\"source_size_bytes\":3964,\"start_line\":1}\n--- exact source range ---\n# Restart authority and accountable disposition\n\n## Frozen findings\n\nThe incident lead may isolate equipment and order emergency stabilization. Only the independent quality unit may release a manufactured lot, and only the site head may authorize commercial restart after current quality, aseptic, utility, and cyber evidence is reconciled.\nEmergency procurement does not waive validated methods, operator qualification, chain of custody, environmental permits, data-integrity controls, or deviation review. A successful mechanical check is not lot release or commercial restart authority.\nA handoff is valid only when the receiving lead acknowledges the same batch genealogy, fill-line configuration, cold-chain map, utility state, and control-system version. A version mismatch blocks closure.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nASSAY and STERILE provide release evidence but cannot authorize release; REVIEW provides independent readiness findings but cannot execute restart.\nCHANGE binds candidate lineage while CHARTER preserves separation among stabilization, execution, verification, release, restart authorization, and closure.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| AUT-000 | incident-lead | v3 | 1.0 | approval | superseded |\n| AUT-001 | quality-unit | v3 | 2.7 | approval | current |\n| AUT-002 | site-head | v3 | 1.5 | approval | current |\n| AUT-003 | regulatory-liaison | v3 | 3.2 | approval | current |\n| AUT-004 | incident-lead | v3 | 2.0 | approval | current |\n| AUT-005 | quality-unit | v3 | 3.7 | approval | current |\n| AUT-006 | site-head | v3 | 2.5 | approval | current |\n| AUT-007 | regulatory-liaison | v3 | 1.3 | approval | current |\n| AUT-008 | incident-lead | v3 | 3.0 | approval | current |\n| AUT