ffect-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"body\":\"The latest independent review found thirteen open findings: four aseptic, three utility, three quality, two cyber, and one communication [REVIEW]. Blocking findings include two missing media fills, stale generator-transfer evidence, unresolved lane-4 stability disposition, and missing quality-unit acknowledgment [REVIEW]. Readiness requires current candidate-bound evidence for every blocking control, independent residual-risk review, and explicit acceptance by each authorized owner [REVIEW]. A successful mechanical check is not lot release or commercial restart authority [CHARTER]. The falsifiers are: yield below 68 percent in two consecutive batches [CULTURE], any contaminated unit in three consecutive media fills [STERILE], discharge above 0.021 milligrams per liter [SAFETY], and alarm latency exceeding p99 thresholds [SIGNAL]. Closure is blocked until all thirteen findings are resolved with current candidate-bound evidence and explicit owner acceptance [REVIEW, CHARTER].\",\"heading\":\"Verification, blockers, falsifiers, and closure\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v009:074c474d71067d91040b81bea2a3ae260ad0d7f0b34322dc2f97096688db7711\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-017\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"074c474d71067d91040b81bea2a3ae260ad0d7f0b34322dc2f97096688db7711\",\"before_sha256\":\"3cbb4b0c965b4f087e4553473a879156b99b0e9efc978f87a9b0e8a6de1e2e00\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v009:074c474d71067d91040b81bea2a3ae260ad0d7f0b34322dc2f97096688db7711\",\"cause\":\"actor_upsert_decision_section\",\"changed_file\":\"BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"current_candidate_verification_status\":\"not_run_after_candidate_effect\",\"prior_check_binding\":null,\"schema\":\"architectur